", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974685_1840524873122821_3055739933188055904_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=W8ZQSaW8XK4Q7kNvwHI0siP&_nc_oc=Adqm4w1Wag50YO-U5x_5Pya2gnbtaIsrCfmKg1NPQGyNMYVxo89ktB8nuVRp1o936bM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0l7yH48gxLdBRPaKKhzkmMf7NkkCSt7ud7ZB64OT8Yyg&oe=69E4DAF9"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "3474397939524850", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974494_3474397942858183_7325370313459975246_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YUhvjxwjp9MQ7kNvwHNoEV5&_nc_oc=AdqjU8jhsW_Tgb2nMV2cNkPcLgV5rZcz5rdPIqwcKKvBUzWjQdGSlrakCbfqlzkB0EY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0u_Ex5NU1zY6qcUhWmUPWcBvXdm-rG2LkFf9vI0Jm9YQ&oe=69E4B98B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Hard Drive Logo (6).png", "id": "1060475455596738", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984476_1060475458930071_8663595066419356644_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=REUoyWo85i8Q7kNvwFhwfEj&_nc_oc=Ado90066bm0SKOozGwTW2SIZ6QKXgYcZGprhaosh6ErQZbZxVfw_w6R7092XMahXc5Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3gOdFvYUnZOMNI3-wlF-_I8KjuKx7SiG2w6OTxdPUPKQ&oe=69E4B80E"}, "display_name": "Hard Drive", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# *Hard Drive* \n\nHard Drive is a fast-paced, multiplayer, competitive electro combat driving game. Players control sleek, neon-lit motorcycle looking vehicles, known as bykes, which leave behind a temporary solid trail of light as they move. Players must outmaneuver their opponents by creating a trails of light that they cannot avoid crashing into, while avoiding the trails left by other players.\n\n# _Current Features_\n- Non PvP Driving Park\n- 6 Player Combat Arena\n- Season Pass with Progression Rewards\n- Cosmetic Shop \n\n## More Coming Soon. . .", "short_description": "Electro Combat Driving "}]}, "devel